The Karazhan Meeting Stone is located near the raid entrance.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\karazhan3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Enter Karazhan Through the Front Door!</h1><br/>
<p>Proceed through the main entrance to begin the raid.<br/><br/>
No attunement is required on Ascension.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\karazhan4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Defeat Prince Malchezaar in Karazhan!</h1><br/>
<p>Prince Malchezaar is the final boss of Karazhan.<br/><br/>
Ascend the tower to face him at the top.</p>

{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\gruul1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Gruul's Lair is in Blade's Edge Mountains!</h1><br/>
<p>The Gruul's Lair raid is located in the northeastern part of Blade's Edge Mountains in Outland.<br/><br/>
Flying to Evergrove or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Blade's Edge Mountains is a quick way to travel to the raid!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\gruul2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
