{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\gruul4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Defeat Gruul the Dragonkiller!</h1><br/>
<p>Gruul the Dragonkiller is the final boss of Gruul's Lair.<br/><br/>
Defeat him after overcoming his minions.</p>

{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\mag1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Magtheridon's Lair is in Hellfire Peninsula!</h1><br/>
<p>The Magtheridon's Lair raid is located within the Hellfire Citadel in Hellfire Peninsula, Outland.<br/><br/>
Flying to Thrallmar or Honor Hold, or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Hellfire Peninsula, is a quick way to travel to the raid!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\mag2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Summon Your Raid at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>
<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your raid, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>
The Magtheridon's Lair Meeting Stone is located outside the entrance to the raid, near the Hellfire Citadel.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\mag3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
