<p>Magtheridon is the sole boss of Magtheridon's Lair.<br/><br/>
Coordinate with your raid to overcome this challenging encounter.</p>

{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\152_1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Serpentshrine Cavern is in Zangarmarsh!</h1><br/>
<p>The Serpentshrine Cavern raid is located within Coilfang Reservoir in Zangarmarsh, Outland.<br/><br/>
Flying to Cenarion Refuge or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Zangarmarsh is a quick way to travel to the raid!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\ssc2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Summon Your Raid at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>
<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your raid, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>
The Serpentshrine Cavern Meeting Stone is located near the entrance inside the underwater tube.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\152_3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Enter Serpentshrine Cavern Through the Underwater Elevator!</h1><br/>
