{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\152_4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Defeat Lady Vashj!</h1><br/>
<p>Lady Vashj is the final boss of Serpentshrine Cavern.<br/><br/>
Navigate through the raid to confront her in the final chamber.</p>

{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\theeye1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">The Eye is in Netherstorm!</h1><br/>
<p>The Eye raid, also known as Tempest Keep, is located on the floating islands in the eastern part of Netherstorm, Outland.<br/><br/>
Flying to Area 52 or using the First-Class Experimental Teleporter to air drop into Netherstorm is a quick way to travel to the raid!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\theeye2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Summon Your Raid at the Meeting Stone!</h1><br/>
<p>Use the Meeting Stone to help summon your raid, or accept a summon from other group members!<br/><br/>
