{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\theeye3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Enter The Eye Through the Main Portal!</h1><br/>
<p>Proceed to the large pink portal to enter the raid.<br/><br/>
