{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wildcardskillcardpacks1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Earn Skill Card Packs from Silas!</h1><br/>
<p>Completing max level Scroll of Fortune quests at Silas grants Sealed Card Packs containing 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>
Use Card Packs from your bags or Skill Cards Menu, then Card Packs and Cards tab.<br/><br/>
Skill Card Packs are found in almost all content. Your Skill Card Collection expands fast!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wildcardskillcardpacks2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Use Your Skill Card Pack to Reveal 5 Cards!</h1><br/>
<p>Each Skill Card Pack contains 5 random max-level Talent Skill Cards.<br/><br/>
Your revealed Skill Cards are automatically added to your Skill Card Collection.<br/><br/>
Your Skill Card Collection is shared across all characters on your account.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wildcardskillcardpacks3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Collect Max-Level Talent Cards!</h1><br/>
<p>Skill Card Packs grant max-level Talent Skill Cards directly.<br/><br/>
Open packs to expand your account-wide collection and give future builds more talent options.</p>

