{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Browse Featured Builds in the Hero Architect!</h1><br/>
<p>Open the Hero Architect to Browse Featured Builds!<br/><br/>
Featured builds are approved builds designed for Rapid Rerolling. These are a great way to jump into end-game build progression and explore new ways to play.<br/><br/>
You can browse builds based on PvE or PvP content, and select one based on your desired role: Tank, Healer, or DPS.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild2:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>
<p>Core Spells and Talents are the bare minimum requirements to use the build.<br/><br/>
Optimal Spells and Talents are the best options for your build. Don't reroll these!<br/><br/>
Empowering Spells and Talents make your build stronger, but are not the strongest option. Reroll these last!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild3:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Import Builds into Rapid Rerolling!</h1><br/>
<p>Select Rapid Roll This Build from the Hero Architect! This will bring you to the Rapid Reroll UI.<br/><br/>
Select Import Hero Architect Build, then select the one you desire from the list.<br/><br/>
Keep in mind that only Featured Builds are guaranteed optimized for Rapid Rerolling. You should inspect community made builds before Rapid Rerolling them!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild4:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Desire All Spells!</h1><br/>
<p>Click Import Hero Architect build, select your desired build, then click Desire All Spells!<br/><br/>
This will mark all Core, Optimal, and Empowering Spells and Talents as Desired entries. This means the Dice will always stop on spells and talents that empower this chosen build!</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild5:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!</h1><br/>
<p>Click Import Hero Architect build, select your desired build, then click Unlearn All Non-Build Spells!<br/><br/>
This sets all spells and talents you currently know that are not in the build as ones you want to reroll!<br/><br/>
This will not set Locked spells or talents to be rerolled. Be sure to unlock non-build spells you wish to reroll.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild6:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">When to Reroll Empowering Spells and Talents!</h1><br/>
<p>As you Rapid Reroll, eventually your entire build will consist of Core, Optimal, and Empowering spells and talents.<br/><br/>
At this point, you can begin marking Empowering Spells and Talents to be unlearned to try to seek out Optimal Spells and Talents!<br/><br/>
You should reroll Empowering entries one at a time to ensure your build retains as much power while rerolling as possible.</p>
{page}
{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild7:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
<h1 align="center">Lock Your Build Spells!</h1><br/>
<p>Click Import Hero Architect build, select your desired build, then click Lock Core, Optimal, Empowering Spells!<br/><br/>
Be sure to lock spells in your build to prevent accidentally rerolling them! This is also a great way to see how many spells and talents you have towards your desired build.</p>

{T:Interface\Tutorials\PtA\wcfeaturedbuild1:1024:406:1024:512:0:1024:59:465}
